# YuriVerse Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values you need.

# --- AniList ---
# AniList's GraphQL API is public and does not require an API key.
# No configuration needed for basic manga/manhwa/manhua/novel discovery.

# --- TMDB (optional: movies & dramas) ---
# Get credentials at https://developer.themoviedb.org/
# VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=your_public_tmdb_read_access_token_here

# --- Supabase (optional: accounts, cross-device sync, admin) ---
# Configure when you need persistent user accounts or admin features.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key_here

# NOTE: Never place secret/server-only credentials in VITE_ prefixed variables.
# Server-side keys (e.g., Supabase service role, TMDB server tokens) should
# only be used in Edge Functions or server environments, never in the browser.
